  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2018_phy_a5.png\">'\r\nAs the object is at centre of the sphere.\r\n$\\therefore$ All rays will fall normally on surface, hence they do not deflect. Thus, a virtual image is formed at the\r\ncentre $O$.\r\n$\\therefore$ Apparent depth $=$ Real depth",
